') so the written-and-reimported STEP passes the gate; validate() alone can miss round-trip failures.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"mesh_open_edge\",\n      \"where\": [\n        64.112,\n        -107.5,\n        -103.994\n      ],\n      \"hint\": \"unclosed tessellated boundary here \\u2014 an unsewn or missing face; sew the shell or add the face\",\n      \"diagnostic_class\": \"mesh_topology\",\n      \"repair_family\": \"repair_nonconformal_face_junction\",\n      \"next_step\": \"Treat the coordinate as a non-conformal face junction; re-patch or re-sew the local faces and verify with export(), not validate() alone.\",\n      \"verify_after_repair\": \"Run export(..., 'step') so the written-and-reimported STEP passes the gate; validate() alone can miss round-trip failures.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"locator_error\",\n      \"detail\": \"RuntimeError('the exact mesh gate could not analyse this shape within its triangle/time budget, so vertex-deflection defects were not located \\u2014 other locators still ran')\",\n      \"diagnostic_class\": \"diagnostic_incomplete\",\n      \"repair_family\": \"rerun_or_cross_check\",\n      \"next_step\": \"The locator skipped one probe; cross-check validate()/export() output and rerun locate_gate_defects() after simplifying or isolating the part.\",\n      \"verify_after_repair\": \"Run export(..., 'step') so the written-and-reimported STEP passes the gate; validate() alone can miss round-trip failures.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"diagnosis\": {\n    \"status\": \"defects_located\",\n    \"primary_kind\": \"brep_invalid_face\",\n    \"counts_by_kind\": {\n      \"brep_invalid_face\": 1,\n      \"locator_error\": 1,\n      \"mesh_open_edge\": 12\n    },\n    \"diagnostic_classes\": [\n      \"brep_quality\",\n      \"mesh_topology\"\n    ],\n    \"repair_families\": [\n      \"rebuild_or_replace_bad_face\",\n      \"repair_nonconformal_face_junction\"\n    ],\n    \"recommended_next_steps\": [\n      \"Open build123d://skill/repair and use the matching repair-family section.\",\n      \"One locator probe was incomplete; use the reported defects plus validate()/export() rather than treating this as exhaustive.\",\n      \"Use face_index/where to inspect the local patch, then rebuild or replace that face explicitly in execute(); avoid broad opaque healing.\",\n      \"After each attempt, restore failed snapshots and verify the written STEP with export().\"\n    ]\n  }\n}"}},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
